    "title": "'Theee Yankees lose!' Vladimir Guerrero Jr., David Ortiz roast Yankees in postgame interview - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By NorthJersey.com Digital Desk ,\n1 hours ago\nVladimir Guerrero Jr. found a moment to troll the Yankees during a jubilant postgame interview.\nWhile on air during the \"MLB on FS1 Postgame\" show, Guerrero Jr., in the middle of jubilant Toronto Blue Jays locker room, took a quick moment to joke with analyst David \"Big Papi\" Ortiz, the Boston Red Sox legend who loves to get under Yankees' fans skin.\n\"Th Yankees lose!\" Guerrero Jr. and Ortiz shouted together several times during the interview, as Ortiz laughed on the set while sitting alongside former Yankees Derek Jeter and Alex Rodriguez.\nJeter didn't appear too happy in the moment.\n\"Th Yankees lose!\" has become Ortiz's signature TV line over the years, a nod to legendary Yankees radio broadcaster John Sterling, famous for his \"Th Yankees win!\" call after New York victories.\nWatch Vladimir Guerrero Jr. and David Ortiz roast Yankees\nThis article originally appeared on NorthJersey.com: 'Theee Yankees lose!' Vladimir Guerrero Jr., David Ortiz roast Yankees in postgame interview",
